# Naming and Imports

## Naming

Folders:

```txt
kebab-case
```

Files:

```txt
kebab-case
```

React components:

```txt
PascalCase
```

Hooks:

```txt
useSomething
```

Effector stores:

```txt
$storeName
```

Effector events:

```txt
actionPerformed
```

Effector effects:

```txt
actionFx
```

Constants:

```txt
UPPER_SNAKE_CASE
```

## Imports

Use aliases for cross-slice imports.

Preferred:

```ts
import { UserCard } from '@/entities/user';
import { Button } from '@/shared/ui';
```

Avoid deep relative imports across slices:

```ts
import { Button } from '../../../../shared/ui';
```

Do not import another slice's internals.
